#: docs/delivery/architecture.md:8
msgid "当前系统架构"
msgstr "Current system architecture"

#: docs/delivery/architecture.md:10
msgid ""
"Nexus 提供静态 C11 通用机制。当前生产 SoC 入口只有 `soc/stm32/stm32f4/`，现有实现 限定 "
"F407VE／ZG；系列复用与精确型号验证分开。厂商依赖全部保留，只有实际选中 闭包进入准备、校验、编译与 SDK。"
msgstr ""
"Nexus provides static C11 generic mechanisms. The sole production SoC entry "
"point is `soc/stm32/stm32f4/`, with existing implementations limited to "
"F407VE/ZG. Series reuse and exact-part validation are separate. All vendor "
"dependencies are retained, while only the selected closure enters "
"preparation, verification, compilation and SDK output."

#: docs/delivery/architecture.md:14
msgid "![FIG-01：平台职责与外部产品边界](../assets/diagrams/platform-architecture.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![FIG-01: platform responsibilities and external product "
"boundaries](../assets/diagrams/platform-architecture.svg)"

#: docs/delivery/architecture.md:14
msgid "FIG-01：平台职责与外部产品边界"
msgstr "FIG-01: platform responsibilities and external product boundaries"

#: docs/delivery/architecture.md:16
msgid "图表达通用职责和构建／调用关系，本轮 MCU 入口为 F4。可选 OS 与组件不是每次 I/O 的强制中间层；物理验收另行取得。"
msgstr ""
"The diagram describes generic responsibilities and build/call relationships. "
"The MCU entry point in this iteration is F4. Optional OS and components are "
"not mandatory intermediaries on each I/O call; physical acceptance is "
"obtained separately."

