#: docs/delivery/architecture.md:35
msgid ""
"完整导航见[源码定位](../explanation/source-map.md)。顶层共享 MCU `drivers/` 已归入 "
"F4，目录移动本身不改变指令数或资源成本。"
msgstr ""
"See the [source map](../explanation/source-map.md) for full navigation. "
"Shared MCU sources formerly under root `drivers/` now belong to F4. Moving "
"directories alone does not change instruction counts or resource costs."

#: docs/delivery/architecture.md:38
msgid "构建与运行"
msgstr "Build and execution"

#: docs/delivery/architecture.md:40
msgid ""
"一份 schema-2 TOML 和只读 SoC／Board JSON 经严格校验、资源计划和不可变 typed IR 生成原子 bundle。CMake"
" 选择已声明的实际源码与链接依赖；生成器不维护平行源码图。"
msgstr ""
"One schema-2 TOML file and readonly SoC/Board JSON pass strict validation, "
"resource planning and immutable typed IR to produce an atomic bundle. CMake "
"selects declared actual sources and link dependencies; the generator "
"maintains no parallel source graph."

#: docs/delivery/architecture.md:43
msgid ""
"每个固件选择精确器件宏和启动文件。厂商头、Handle 和可变 provider 状态私有； 生成器按选中实例定容配置、状态、buffer、只读 face"
" 与强类型 factory。"
msgstr ""
"Each firmware selects an exact device macro and startup file. Vendor headers,"
" Handles and mutable provider state remain private. The generator sizes "
"configuration, state, buffers, readonly faces and the strongly typed factory "
"for selected instances."

#: docs/delivery/architecture.md:46
msgid ""
"运行中 factory 只返回已有接口。日常 I/O 通过 `ops(context, ...)` 直接进入 F4 实现，硬件操作优先复用官方 "
"HAL／LL。不会因共享源码引入最大池、动态注册表、 默认堆或隐藏 worker。应用负责串行执行者、服务进度和 scheduler 启动。"
msgstr ""
"At runtime the factory only returns existing interfaces. Ordinary I/O calls "
"enter F4 implementations directly through `ops(context, ...)`, preferring "
"official HAL/LL operations. Shared source introduces no maximum-sized pool, "
"dynamic registry, default heap or hidden worker. Applications own serialized "
"execution, service progress and scheduler startup."

#: docs/delivery/architecture.md:50
msgid "生命周期与失败"
msgstr "Lifecycle and failure"

#: docs/delivery/architecture.md:52
msgid ""
"F4 C 实现维护资源准入、取得、收条、硬件撤回和 readback。部分取得失败必须处理 "
"当前步骤已经产生的效果，再逆序撤回前序步骤；失败释放保留实际责任。"
msgstr ""
"F4 C implementations maintain resource admission, acquisition, receipts, "
"hardware withdrawal and readback. A partially failed acquisition must handle "
"effects already produced by the current step before reversing earlier steps. "
"Failed release retains actual responsibility."

#: docs/delivery/architecture.md:55
msgid ""
"ACCEPTED 后借用请求与 buffer，直到 acquire 观察 SETTLED。DMA 完成、线上完成、 IRQ／callback "
"撤回和最终发布分别证明；timeout／cancel 不提前释放借用。 QUARANTINED 保留存储与恢复责任，观察者和 adapter 还需独立 "
"join。"
msgstr ""
"After ACCEPTED, requests and buffers remain borrowed until acquire observes "
"SETTLED. DMA completion, wire completion, IRQ/callback withdrawal and final "
"publication require separate proofs; timeout/cancel does not release borrows "
"early. QUARANTINED retains storage and recovery duties. Observers and "
"adapters also require independent join."

#: docs/delivery/architecture.md:59
msgid ""
"启动外部 SRAM、已启 watchdog 和保留 RTC 状态不能套用普通关闭。HAL 与自写 实现也不能各自独立推进同一个 live "
"controller 行为域。"
msgstr ""
"External SRAM used at startup, an already enabled watchdog and retained RTC "
"state cannot use ordinary shutdown blindly. HAL and a private implementation "
"also cannot independently advance the same live controller behavior domain."

#: docs/delivery/architecture.md:68
msgid ""
"其他 F4 型号需要精确内存、封装、时钟、DMA、IRQ 与硬件 profile；官方 HAL 覆盖 不建立 Nexus "
"全系列资格。当前软件验证绑定本次执行，旧记录不继承；物理 HIL 为 "
"`not_executed`。精确边界见[支持](support.md)与[资格](../reference/platforms/qualification.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Other F4 parts need exact memory, package, clock, DMA, IRQ and hardware "
"profiles. Official HAL coverage does not establish Nexus series-wide "
"qualification. Current software validation is bound to this execution and "
"does not inherit old records; physical HIL is `not_executed`. See "
"[support](support.md) and "
"[qualification](../reference/platforms/qualification.md) for exact "
"boundaries."

#: docs/delivery/architecture.md:0
msgid "结果、单调 deadline、请求与借用规则、整平台冷态协调"
msgstr ""
"Results, monotonic deadlines, request and borrow rules, and whole-platform "
"cold coordination"

#: docs/delivery/architecture.md:55
msgid ""
"默认静态装配通过 `nx_platform_lifecycle_start/stop` 进入 Core 手写 C 协调器。 全部 controller "
"准入先于硬件效果；随后依次建立 System、共享资源与 controller。 失败按逆序撤回，在首个释放拒绝处保留剩余责任，后续 stop "
"只重试未完成部分。 primary、cleanup、remaining effects 和调用期诊断独立保留，不以清理成功覆盖原始失败。 F4 的 "
"System／DMA／SYSCFG／pins／CAN／Ethernet 共享责任由其私有 C 协调器处理。"
msgstr ""
"The default static assembly enters the handwritten Core C coordinator "
"through `nx_platform_lifecycle_start/stop`. All controller admissions "
"precede hardware effects; System, shared resources and controllers are then "
"established in order. Failure triggers reverse withdrawal, retaining "
"remaining responsibility at the first release refusal; later stop calls "
"retry only unfinished work. Primary, cleanup, remaining effects and call-"
"scoped diagnostics remain independent; successful cleanup never overwrites "
"the original failure. F4 handles shared System/DMA/SYSCFG/pins/CAN/Ethernet "
"responsibility in its private C coordinator."

#: docs/delivery/architecture.md:68
msgid "当前实现与后续边界"
msgstr "Current implementation and remaining boundaries"

#: docs/delivery/architecture.md:70
msgid ""
"Board／SoC 不再保留 Python 插件。默认主机工具仍使用 Python 校验与生成静态对象、 只读 plan、按索引选择的固定 typed "
"call 和薄 IRQ 入口；启动、停止、回滚与诊断控制流 由手写 C 维护。既有 `nx_lifecycle_*` "
"可撤销资源事务与整平台协调器职责不同，不要求 为统一外观把全部驱动改接同一组 ops。"
msgstr ""
"Board and SoC packages contain no Python plugins. The default host tool "
"still uses Python to validate and generate static objects, readonly plans, "
"fixed typed calls selected by index and thin IRQ entries. Handwritten C owns"
" startup, stop, rollback and diagnostic control flow. The existing "
"`nx_lifecycle_*` reversible-resource transactions and the whole-platform "
"coordinator have different responsibilities; a uniform appearance does not "
"require every driver to use the same operations table."

#: docs/delivery/architecture.md:75
msgid ""
"Host C11 `nxconfig` 是可选主机试点，其全面替换不作为固件 C 化或软件交付前置。 新增协调状态不是零 RAM，也不改变日常 I/O "
"热路径；实际资源、模型行为、ARM 链接和 物理测量各自验收，不能从源码迁移推导整平台通过。"
msgstr ""
"Host C11 `nxconfig` is an optional host pilot; full replacement is not a "
"prerequisite for moving firmware behavior to C or delivering software. The "
"new coordination state is not zero RAM and does not change ordinary I/O hot "
"paths. Actual resources, model behavior, ARM linking and physical "
"measurements are accepted separately; source migration cannot establish a "
"whole-platform pass."
